@startuml "Visitor - Compiler (GoF) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title GoF's motivation — Design Patterns, pp. 331-344
interface Node <<Element>> {
  + accept(NodeVisitor)
}
class AssignmentNode
class VariableRefNode
class ConstantNode
class AddNode
interface NodeVisitor <<Visitor>> {
  + visitAssignment(AssignmentNode)
  + visitVariableRef(VariableRefNode)
  + visitConstant(ConstantNode)
  + visitAdd(AddNode)
}
class TypeCheckingVisitor
class CodeGeneratingVisitor
class PrettyPrintingVisitor
Node <|.. AssignmentNode
Node <|.. VariableRefNode
Node <|.. ConstantNode
Node <|.. AddNode
NodeVisitor <|.. TypeCheckingVisitor
NodeVisitor <|.. CodeGeneratingVisitor
NodeVisitor <|.. PrettyPrintingVisitor
note right of Node
  Before the pattern, every node had
  typeCheck(), generateCode() and
  prettyPrint(). See gof.problem.
end note
@enduml
